<title>GERMANY: German car registrations climb in April.</title>
<headline>German car registrations climb in April.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of new car registrations in Germany climbed for the first time this year from the same month in 1996 in April, the VDA German Automobile Association said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The VDA said registrations climbed four percent during the month to an estimated 350,000 units. Registrations in March and April declined a total of three percent.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
